    <string name="about_offline_title">Aap ka data aap ke paas</string>
    <string name="about_offline_text">DT Salon Management internet ke baghair chalti hai. Aap ke salon ka data isi phone mein mehfooz rehta hai; sirf account aur licence online check hote hain. Mehfooz copy ke liye Backup istemal karein.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Yeh kya karti hai</string>
    <string name="about_features_text">Receipt aur Bluetooth printing ke saath sales counter, customers aur visits ki history, services aur qeematein, staff commission aur payments, karobari aur ghar ke kharche, cash counter, targets, budget, reports aur mashware.</string>
